* M5218AL dual low-noise op-amp (Mitsubishi; a 4558 type, SIL-8): the Boss BD-2's (our model from Mitsubishi's M5218AL/P/FP sheet)
* Built by Solum Builder from Mitsubishi M5218AL/P/FP data sheet (data book pages 2-467 to 2-471, with the 8P2S-A outline of March 1998), at ±15 V; phase margin assumed (D-169) (D-162)
.subckt M5218AL 1 2 3 4 5
* pins: + - V+ V- out. Built by Solum Builder from the sheet's typical figures (D-162)
Rin 1 2 1e+12
Rc1 1 mid 1e12
Rc2 2 mid 1e12
Emid mid 4 3 4 0.5
Bgm mid g I=1e-05*tanh(16.9288*(V(1)-V(2)))
R1 g mid 1.86799e+09
C1 g mid 3.33333e-12
Vhp 3 hp DC 0.8
Vhn hn 4 DC 0.8
Dhi g hp DCLAMP
Dlo hn g DCLAMP
Ebuf b 0 g 0 1
Rp b p 1000
Cp p 0 1.31269e-11
Eout o 0 p 0 1
Vsense o o2 0
Rout o2 5 180
Bsrc 3 0 I=max(i(Vsense),0)
Bsnk 0 4 I=max(-i(Vsense),0)
Iq 3 4 DC 0.0015
.model DCLAMP D(is=1e-15 n=0.05)
.ends
